    markdown: "## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Is Servana only a booking system?\n\nNo. Servana is built for service operations. It supports the work behind bookings, walk-ins, clients, staff, invoices, offline payments, commissions, platform fees, and audit records.\n\n### Who is the platform dashboard for?\n\nThe platform dashboard is for you as the platform owner. It helps you manage merchants, settings, fees, reports, permissions, audit logs, and platform-level controls.\n\n### Do clients pay through Servana?\n\nClient-to-merchant payments are handled offline. Servana helps record payment method, amount, reference, status, and validation details.\n\n### Can I control platform fees?\n\nYes. You can configure platform service fees, billing cycles, contact-download fees, and preferred-personnel waiting fees.\n\n### Can merchants manage their own teams?\n\nYes. Merchants can manage their branches, staff, services, clients, queues, invoices, payments, receipts, and commissions based on their assigned permissions.\n\n### Can clients choose a preferred staff member?\n\nYes. Clients can choose the next available personnel or wait for a specific personnel at an extra fee controlled by you.\n\n---",
